with Oat Topping",description:"Seasonal berries baked with a golden oat crumble, served warm with vanilla bean ice cream.",price:"$10"}]},versionedSchema:T7["feature-menu-list-text"],colorTokensSchema:or.colorTokensSchema}),IQ=T8({id:"feature-mini-image-cards",name:"Feature Mini Image Cards",description:"A grid layout showcasing features with small images and descriptions, or full-bleed images",type:"feature",visualConfigPresets:[],exampleConfig:{kicker:"Our Philosophy",heading:"Mindful guidance and movement created to support your well-being.",description:"We believe yoga is for everyone. Our practice goes beyond the mat, fostering a lifestyle of mindfulness, connection, and growth.",items:[{type:"card",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544367567-0f2fcb009e0b?w=800&q=80",alt:"Peaceful Environment"},title:"Peaceful Environment",description:"A calm, welcoming space where you can relax, recharge, and reconnect with yourself through mindful practice."},{type:"card",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?w=800&q=80",alt:"Trusted Expertise"},title:"Trusted Expertise",description:"Led by experienced teachers passionate about wellness, guiding every class with clarity and compassion."},{type:"image",src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588286840104-8957b019727f?w=800&q=80",alt:"Yoga practice"}]},versionedSchema:T7["feature-mini-image-cards"],colorTokensSchema:ol.colorTokensSchema}),IJ=T8({id:"feature-portrait-carousel",name:"Feature Portrait Carousel",description:"A horizontally scrollable carousel of portrait cards with images, titles, and descriptions.",type:"feature",visualConfigPresets:[{}],exampleConfig:{kicker:"Classes",heading:"Practice options for every body and every day",items:[{title:"Vinyasa Flow",description:"A dynamic practice linking breath with movement. Build heat, strength, and flexibility in this energizing flow.",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599901860904-17e6ed7083a0?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",alt:"Vinyasa Flow"}},{title:"Hatha Foundations",description:"Focus on alignment and holding postures. Perfect for beginners or those seeking a grounded, steady practice.",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545205597-3d9d02c29597?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",alt:"Hatha Foundations"}},{title:"Yin + Restore",description:"Slow-paced style with deep stretches held for longer periods. Targets connective tissues and cultivates stillness.",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518611012118-696072aa579a?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",alt:"Yin + Restore"}},{title:"Breathwork + Meditation",description:"Guided pranayama and mindfulness techniques to reduce stress, improve focus, and connect with your inner self.",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",alt:"Breathwork + Meditation"}},{title:"Private Sessions",description:"Personalized instruction tailored to your unique needs and goals.",image:{src:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1575052814086-f385e2e2ad1b?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",alt:"Private Sessions"}}]},versionedSchema:T7["feature-portrait-carousel"],colorTokensSchema:op.colorTokensSchema}),I1=T8({id:"feature-progress-accordion",name:"Feature Progress Accordion",description:"A feature section with a large editorial intro, CTA, progress accordion list, and active image.",type:"feature",visualConfigPresets:[{showButtons:!0}],exampleConfig:{kicker:"What we offer",heading:"Inspired by nature's unrefined beauty, we established a studio that breaks away from traditional floristry.",buttons:[{label:"Explore Services",href:"#services",actionType:"section"}],items:[{title:"Wedding Floristry",description:"Wedding floristry involves designing and arranging beautiful floral decorations that enhance the ambiance of your special day, from bouquets to centerpieces and venue adornments.",image:{src:"https://rjdavx8ozyznxeyh.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/production/websites