rate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","oswald-inter","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","archivo-alegreya","anybody-frank-ruhl-libre","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif","josefin-sans-karla","rethink-sans-commissioner","funnel-display-onest","raleway-lato"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"josefin-sans-karla",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-marketer":{overrides:{isSticky:!0}}},footer:{"footer-detached":{}},banner:{"banner-full-image":{overrides:{showButtons:!1,fillViewport:!0}}},feature:{"feature-menu-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}},"feature-three-card":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-single-carousel":{overrides:{showImages:!1}}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table-2":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{overrides:{imagePosition:"right"}}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{}},showcase:{"showcase-list":{}},text:{"text-basic":{}},metrics:{"metrics-numbers":{}},location:{"location-card":{overrides:{tinted:!0,mapType:"roadmap"}}},embed:{},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"pure-vitality":{id:"pure-vitality",name:"Pure Vitality",description:"Electric contrast minimalism — stark dark canvases, vivid accent color, modern sans-serif type, clean layouts, and immersive full-width sections. Best for an energetic, action-oriented look.",tags:["energetic","modern","high-contrast"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"3f03b879-8b06-4b24-9b24-77e81cc8e601",name:"Energizing Contrast",description:"A high-contrast, energetic palette featuring vibrant primary accents against stark dark and clean light backgrounds. The high-saturation primary color provides sharp, striking highlights that draw attention and inspire action. Designed for modern wellness, fitness brands, and energetic lifestyles.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#ECE800",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["instrument-serif-inter","modern","elegant-serif","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","raleway-lato","fredoka-quicksand","signika-asap","gabarito-atkinson-hyperlegible-next","sora-barlow","josefin-sans-karla","bitter-nunito-sans","manrope-lora","playpen-sans-grandstander"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"instrument-serif-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-detached-transparent":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",isTransparent:!0,isSticky:!1}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split",fillViewport:!0}}},feature:{"feature-three-card":{},"feature-portrait-carousel":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},gallery:{"gallery-slideshow":{}},showcase:{"showcase-grid-highlight":{}},metrics:{"metrics-card-highlight":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},location:{"location-map":{}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-detached":{}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"midnight-aurora":{id:"midnight-aurora",name:"Midnight Aurora",description:"Dramatic premium minimalism — dark canvases, luminous accent color, large rounded forms, crisp sans-serif type, and structured high-contrast layouts. Best for a polished, professional look.",tags:["premium","dramatic","professional","modern"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"deep-contrast",name:"Deep Contrast",description:"A bold, high-contrast color palette featuring deeply saturated primary tones paired with vibrant, chromatic secondary accents. The primary scale offers rich, saturated solid colors against near-white backgrounds, creating dramatic visual impact. The secondary provides energetic accent colors with high saturation throughout. Strong brightness contrast between light backgrounds and dark solid colors creates clear visual hierarchy. Ideal for tech-forward, creative, or statement-making applications requiring bold visual presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#EECF29",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"light-elegant",name:"Light Elegant",description:"A light and airy color palette with clean white backgrounds and subtle chromatic accents. Features refined indigo and violet tones that provide elegant contrast against bright, near-white surfaces. The primary and secondary scales offer gentle chromatic touches while maintaining excellent readability. Neutral tones are crisp and minimal, creating a sophisticated, modern aesthetic. Perfect for professional, clean, and contemporary applications requiring clarity and refinement.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["instrument-serif-inter","elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif","anybody-frank-ruhl-libre","funnel-display-onest","familjen-grotesk-be-vietnam-pro","rethink-sans-commissioner","josefin-sans-karla","raleway-lato","archivo-alegreya","red-hat-display-source-serif-4"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"instrument-serif-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-marketer":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",showButtons:!0}}},banner:{"banner-bento-grid":{overrides:{fillViewport:!0}}},feature:{"feature-centered-carousel":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-grid":{}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-card":{}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-nav":{overrides:{showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"alpina-ventures":{id:"alpina-ventures",name:"Alpina Ventures",description:"Bold electric minimalism — saturated monochromatic base, crisp white sans-serif type, high contrast. Best for a bold, electric look.",tags:["bold","modern","high-contrast"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"alpine-summit",name:"Alpine Summit",description:"A cool, adventure-ready palette featuring muted steel-blue primary tones paired with deep violet secondary accents and a saturated royal-blue theme color. Light primary surfaces keep ski and travel photography readable, while the bold accent delivers confident highlights on calls to action. Backgrounds lean on soft accent tints for a crisp alpine atmosphere with strong neutral contrast. Ideal for ski operators, outdoor excursion brands, boutique travel companies, and premium adventure services in cold-climate destinations.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#0D21E6",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["instrument-serif-inter","modern","elegant-serif","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","josefin-sans-karla","bitter-nunito-sans","manrope-lora"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"instrument-serif-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"center",showSocial:!1,isSticky:!1,showButtons:!0}}},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},banner:{"banner-double-image-bottom":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}},"banner-diagonal-grid":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}},"banner-card-and-background-image":{overrides:{fullscreenOptions:{fillViewport:!0,verticalAlignment:"center"},showButtons:!0}}},feature:{"feature-portrait-carousel":{},"feature-carousel-accordion":{},"feature-text-stacked":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"center"}},"gallery-flat-bento":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"center"}}},showcase:{"showcase-list":{}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel":{overrides:{showDotsOnDesktop:!0,showButtons:!0,showImages:!0}}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0,showButtons:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table-3":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}},"pricing-table":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",showButtons:!0}}},location:{"location-business-hours":{},"location-map":{overrides:{mapType:"roadmap",zoom:15}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},cta:{"cta-basic":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center",showButtons:!0}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},embed:{},blog:{"blog-feed":{}}}},"steady-ascent":{id:"steady-ascent",name:"Steady Ascent",description:"Polished aspirational minimalism — clean backgrounds, warm accent tones, clear typographic hierarchy, and structured layouts with subtle visual depth. Best for an approachable, confident look.",tags:["professional","polished","modern"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"steady-growth",name:"Steady Growth",description:"A trustworthy, professional color palette featuring moderate-saturation navy primary tones paired with warm, approachable gold secondary accents. The primary scale offers balanced saturation solid colors against clean backgrounds, creating a sense of stability and reliability. The secondary provides warm accent colors that convey optimism and forward momentum. Clear brightness contrast between light backgrounds and deep solid colors establishes professional hierarchy. Ideal for financial services, coaching, consulting, and professional service businesses seeking to convey trust and competence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#D4A017",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clean-confidence",name:"Clean Confidence",description:"A clean, minimalist color palette featuring soft teal primary tones paired with light, airy backgrounds. Both scales offer low-to-moderate saturation with high brightness, creating a fresh and approachable atmosphere. The subtle color differences evoke clarity and simplicity, reflecting a judgment-free, accessible approach to financial guidance. Perfect for financial coaches, advisors, and wellness-focused financial services seeking to reduce client stress and build trust through visual calm.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#2A9D8F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["modern","elegant-serif","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","literata-noto-sans","newsreader-plus-jakarta-sans","raleway-lato","rethink-sans-commissioner","sora-barlow","vollkorn-jost","manrope-lora","bitter-nunito-sans"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"playfair-source",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"inline-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",showSocial:!1,showButtons:!0}}},banner:{"banner-card-and-background-image":{overrides:{fullscreenOptions:{fillViewport:!0,verticalAlignment:"bottom"}}}},feature:{"feature-carousel-accordion":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel":{overrides:{showDotsOnDesktop:!0}}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},cta:{"cta-basic":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"sharp-signal":{id:"sharp-signal",name:"Sharp Signal",description:"Bold saturated maximalism — rich full-bleed background, chunky serif type, high-energy layout, minimal whitespace. Best for a vibrant, lively look.",tags:["bold","creative","playful"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"bright-studio",name:"Bright Studio",description:"A bright, high-clarity color palette featuring lightly saturated, high-brightness primary tones paired with a more luminous supporting surface and a vivid accent highlight. The primary scale creates an open editorial canvas, while the secondary introduces slightly higher brightness for layered surfaces and the accent delivers punchy emphasis without overwhelming the composition. Strong dark neutrals maintain crisp hierarchy. Ideal for creative studios, agencies, and modern service brands seeking an optimistic, design-forward aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#71C1EC",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-studio",name:"Deep Studio",description:"A dark, high-contrast palette built around low-brightness primary surfaces with near-black supporting layers and a vivid accent for high-attention moments. The primary scale establishes a refined, editorial foundation, while the secondary deepens surface separation and the accent introduces a saturated burst of energy. Cool muted neutrals preserve legibility across the dark canvas. Ideal for creative agencies, premium brands, and design-led businesses seeking a sharp after-hours aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#313A3F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sharp-signal-sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["literata-noto-sans","plus-jakarta-sans-inter","modern","figtree","lexend","work-sans-rubik","elegant-serif","playfair-source","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","roboto-serif-dm-sans","crimson-pro","montagu-slab"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"literata-noto-sans",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",isSticky:!0,showButtons:!1,showSocial:!0}}},banner:{"banner-text-only":{overrides:{fillViewport:!1,showButtons:!0}}},feature:{"feature-three-card":{},"feature-menu-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"center"}}},showcase:{"showcase-bento-cards":{}},gallery:{"gallery-flat-bento":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"split"}}},metrics:{"metrics-card-highlight":{overrides:{showButtons:!1}}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table-3":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}}},faq:{"faq-card":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}}},location:{"location-text-and-map":{overrides:{mapPositionOptions:{mapPosition:"bottom",textAlignment:"left",hasImagePadding:!1},fillViewportOptions:{fillViewport:!1},mapType:"roadmap",zoom:14,tinted:!0,showButtons:!1}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-highlight":{overrides:{showSocial:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"strategic-insight":{id:"strategic-insight",name:"Strategic Insight",description:"Warm editorial minimalism — off-white canvas, serif type, generous whitespace, muted natural tones. Best for a refined, professional look.",tags:["professional","editorial","minimal","warm"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"forest-canvas",name:"Forest Canvas",description:"A soft and organic color palette featuring desaturated, muted forest green primary tones paired with warm, near-neutral canvas backgrounds. The primary scale offers low-saturation solid colors against high-brightness warm backgrounds, while the secondary provides gentle warmth through minimally saturated cream tones. High brightness range creates clear hierarchy. Ideal for business coaching, consulting, and professional services seeking understated elegance and trust.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#405F40",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"executive-slate",name:"Executive Slate",description:"A dark, low-saturation color palette featuring slate-teal primary tones paired with cool, misted secondary accents. The primary scale anchors the template with low-brightness blue-green slate backgrounds, while the secondary introduces softened, higher-brightness teal-gray highlights that keep key actions and surfaces crisp. Strong dark-to-light contrast creates decisive hierarchy and a modern executive tone. Ideal for executive coaches, leadership advisors, and consulting practices seeking composure, authority, and contemporary clarity.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#044C68",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["ibm-plex-serif-inter","instrument-serif-inter","elegant-serif","playfair-source","libre-baskerville","crimson-pro","modern","fraunces-open-sans","montagu-slab","bricolage-grotesque","space-grotesk","syne-geist","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","nunito","albert-sans","literata-noto-sans","newsreader-plus-jakarta-sans","vollkorn-jost","manrope-lora","rethink-sans-commissioner","sora-barlow","raleway-lato","petrona-hanken-grotesk","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"ibm-plex-serif-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"center",showSocial:!1,showButtons:!0}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-image":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"center"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},feature:{"feature-centered-carousel":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"left"}}},metrics:{"metrics-numbers":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},location:{"location-text-and-map":{overrides:{mapPositionOptions:{mapPosition:"bottom",textAlignment:"center",hasImagePadding:!0},fillViewportOptions:{fillViewport:!1}}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},cta:{"cta-basic":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"heritage-drive":{id:"heritage-drive",name:"Heritage Drive",description:"Heritage editorial refinement — deep green accents, warm canvas backgrounds, generous spacing, and bento grids with a composed rhythm. Best for a polished, timeless look.",tags:["refined","editorial","timeless"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"classic-heritage",name:"Classic Heritage",description:"A heritage-inspired color palette featuring low-saturation warm canvas tones paired with a deep, low-brightness accent scale. The primary background stays bright and understated while the accent provides strong, refined contrast for key actions and editorial emphasis. Ideal for premium craft, restoration, automotive, and specialty service businesses that need a classic but polished presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#004225",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["default","elegant-serif","modern","outfit","playfair-source","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","platypi-maven-pro","manrope-lora","red-hat-display-source-serif-4"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"platypi-maven-pro",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{isSticky:!1,showSocial:!0}}},footer:{"footer-logo-highlight":{}},banner:{"banner-text-and-image":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,fillViewportOptions:{fillViewport:!0},imagePositionOptions:{imagePosition:"bottom",textAlignment:"center",hasImagePadding:!0}}}},feature:{"feature-expandable-carousel":{overrides:{textContentAlignment:"center"}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-fullscreen-slider":{}},gallery:{"gallery-flat-bento":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},pricing:{"pricing-table-2":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}}},team:{"team-grid":{}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},faq:{"faq-accordion-image":{}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{itemSize:"sm",showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"center"}}},text:{"text-basic":{}},metrics:{"metrics-card-grid":{}},location:{"location-map":{overrides:{zoom:15,mapType:"roadmap"}}},embed:{},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"honest-craft":{id:"honest-craft",name:"Honest Craft",description:"Warm craftsman structure — light beige canvas, wood-toned warmth, bold orange accents, sharp square corners, and blocky bento-style layouts. Best for a trustworthy, handcrafted look.",tags:["warm","rustic","structured"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"warm-craftsman",name:"Warm Craftsman",description:"A warm, craftsman-inspired color palette featuring rich amber-orange accents paired with soft beige backgrounds. The primary scale provides warm wood-tone oranges with high saturation for bold, confident statements. The secondary scale offers gentle beige and cream tones with low saturation for subtle, approachable backgrounds. High brightness contrast between dark text and light backgrounds ensures excellent readability. Ideal for carpentry, woodworking, construction, and home services businesses seeking a trustworthy, handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#F9AB36",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dark-workshop",name:"Dark Workshop",description:"A dark, workshop-inspired palette built around deep walnut-brown surfaces with warm amber highlights. The primary scale delivers low-brightness tones that feel grounded and premium, while the secondary scale introduces focused, high-visibility warmth for calls-to-action and key accents. Neutralized supporting colors keep text highly legible over dark backgrounds and preserve the handcrafted, trustworthy mood. Ideal for carpentry, custom furniture makers, renovation specialists, and trades brands that want a refined after-hours aesthetic without losing approachability.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#3A2F29",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["elegant-serif","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","playfair-source","crimson-pro","montagu-slab","roboto-serif-dm-sans","modern","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","bitter-nunito-sans","vollkorn-jost","signika-asap","petrona-hanken-grotesk","literata-noto-sans","manrope-lora","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif","red-hat-display-source-serif-4"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"roboto-serif-dm-sans",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"right",showSocial:!0,showButtons:!1}}},banner:{"banner-double-image-bottom":{}},feature:{"feature-bento-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-grid":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{overrides:{imagePosition:"right"}}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},location:{"location-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"urban-edge":{id:"urban-edge",name:"Urban Edge",description:"Urban high-contrast intensity — near-black tones, electric orange accents, sharp corners, and modern typography. Best for a powerful, high-energy look.",tags:["bold","energetic","high-contrast"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"bold-contrast",name:"Bold Contrast",description:"A bold, high-energy color palette featuring deep, dark navy primary tones paired with vibrant, high-saturation bright green secondary accents. The primary offers low brightness with moderate saturation, creating a sophisticated dark canvas. The secondary provides maximum saturation and brightness for energetic accent colors that pop with intensity. High contrast between dark backgrounds and bright accents creates a sleek, powerful atmosphere. Ideal for fitness, sports, urban lifestyle, and action-oriented brands seeking a modern, high-performance aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#00FF48",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-vitality",name:"Electric Vitality",description:"A clean, high-energy light palette featuring crisp, high-brightness backgrounds paired with vibrant electric green accents. The primary scale offers maximum brightness with minimal saturation for an airy, fresh canvas. The secondary provides maximum saturation electric green that ensures key actions pop with intense energy while maintaining a modern, performance-driven aesthetic. Clear brightness contrast between light backgrounds and vivid green accents creates dynamic visual hierarchy. Perfect for fitness, sports, and action-oriented brands seeking an accessible yet high-energy appearance.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#39FF14",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeCol