gy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","oswald-inter","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","archivo-alegreya","anybody-frank-ruhl-libre","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif","josefin-sans-karla","rethink-sans-commissioner","funnel-display-onest","raleway-lato"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"oswald-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"right",showButtons:!0,showSocial:!1}}},banner:{"banner-card":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}}},feature:{"feature-bento-grid":{},"feature-carousel":{},"feature-carousel-accordion":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"center"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel":{}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center"}}},cta:{"cta-basic":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split"}},"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{overrides:{imagePosition:"right"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-nav":{overrides:{showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"modern-foundation":{id:"modern-foundation",name:"Modern Foundation",description:"Soft structural minimalism — cream canvas, warm terracotta accents, elegant serif type, rounded corners, and balanced bento-style layouts. Best for a refined, contemporary look with calm confidence.",tags:["refined","modern","minimal"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"modern-light",name:"Modern Light",description:"A refined, minimal color palette featuring soft cream and beige primary tones with warm copper-terracotta accents. The primary scale offers low-saturation, high-brightness colors that create a clean, professional atmosphere. The secondary provides strong contrast for text and emphasis. Creates a sophisticated, modern aesthetic. Ideal for architectural firms, design studios, professional services, and creative agencies seeking a polished, contemporary presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#D4A574",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-dark",name:"Modern Dark",description:"A sophisticated dark palette featuring deep charcoal and warm black primary tones with golden-copper accents. The primary scale uses low brightness for backgrounds, creating a refined, focused atmosphere. The accent provides warm highlights. Ideal for architectural firms, design studios, and professional services seeking a sophisticated, contemporary dark mode presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#E7D23C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","outfit","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","raleway-lato","josefin-sans-karla","libre-bodoni-chivo","sora-barlow","rethink-sans-commissioner","funnel-display-onest","platypi-maven-pro","manrope-lora","red-hat-display-source-serif-4"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"outfit",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-detached-transparent":{overrides:{navAlignment:"right",isSticky:!0,isTransparent:!1}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-image":{overrides:{imagePositionOptions:{imagePosition:"top",textAlignment:"split",hasImagePadding:!0},fillViewportOptions:{fillViewport:!0,verticalAlignment:"bottom"}}}},feature:{"feature-bento-grid":{}},gallery:{"gallery-flat-bento":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-list":{}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{}},location:{"location-map":{}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-highlight":{}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"reliable-core":{id:"reliable-core",name:"Reliable Core",description:"Structured modern clarity — balanced chromatic palettes, moderate rounded corners, clean sans-serif typography, and organized grid layouts. Best for a dependable, polished look.",tags:["professional","modern","structured"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"dependable-tech",name:"Dependable Tech",description:"A professional, tech-forward color palette featuring moderate-saturation blue primary tones paired with clean, neutral secondary accents. The primary scale offers confident, trustworthy blue solid colors against crisp backgrounds, creating a sense of reliability and technical competence. The secondary provides cool neutral tones that support readability and professionalism. Clear brightness contrast between light backgrounds and saturated solid colors establishes modern hierarchy. Ideal for IT services, tech companies, managed service providers, and B2B technology businesses seeking to convey expertise and dependability.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#0F172A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"secure-systems",name:"Secure Systems",description:"A clean, enterprise-focused color palette featuring deep indigo primary tones paired with warm gold accents. The primary scale offers professional, security-conscious colors that convey stability and protection. The secondary provides a warm accent that suggests premium quality within reliability. Balanced saturation creates a polished, corporate feel. Perfect for cybersecurity firms, enterprise IT services, and managed service providers seeking to project both technical sophistication and trustworthiness.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#271C2D",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["modern","space-grotesk","space-grotesk-inter","bricolage-grotesque","nunito","albert-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","elegant-serif","playfair-source","oswald-source","unbounded-geist","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","familjen-grotesk-be-vietnam-pro","rethink-sans-commissioner","funnel-display-onest","schibsted-grotesk-noto-serif","raleway-lato","josefin-sans-karla","gabarito-atkinson-hyperlegible-next","red-hat-display-source-serif-4"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"space-grotesk-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-detached-transparent":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",showButtons:!0,isTransparent:!1,isSticky:!1}}},banner:{"banner-diagonal-grid":{}},feature:{"feature-grid":{overrides:{imageOptions:{showImages:!0,isCaptionInside:!1}}}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel":{overrides:{showDotsOnDesktop:!0}}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table-2":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion-image":{}},cta:{"cta-card-2":{overrides:{textAlignment:"left"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-nav":{overrides:{showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"serene-wellness":{id:"serene-wellness",name:"Serene Wellness",description:"Airy geometric minimalism — light canvas, clean sans-serif type, circular orbital layout. Best for a fresh, modern look.",tags:["fresh","modern","minimal","bright"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"calming-nature",name:"Calming Nature",description:"A serene, calming color palette featuring soft sage green primary tones paired with gentle lavender secondary accents. The primary scale offers low-saturation, high-brightness colors that evoke natural tranquility. The secondary provides subtle warmth through barely-there lavender tints. Creates a peaceful, zen-like atmosphere with minimal visual noise. Ideal for wellness centers, spas, yoga studios, and health-focused businesses seeking calm, restorative presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#8B5CF6",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"zen-minimal",name:"Zen Minimal",description:"A minimal, zen-inspired color palette using soft mint green with complementary jade accents. Both scales feature very low saturation and high brightness, creating an airy, spa-like atmosphere. The extremely subtle color differences evoke simplicity and mindfulness. Perfect for meditation apps, wellness retreats, and minimalist health brands seeking peaceful, uncluttered visual identity.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#D03F82",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["outfit","elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","raleway-lato","josefin-sans-karla","manrope-lora","signika-asap","gabarito-atkinson-hyperlegible-next","fredoka-quicksand","literata-noto-sans","rethink-sans-commissioner","playpen-sans-grandstander"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"outfit",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"center",showSocial:!0,showButtons:!1}}},banner:{"banner-orbit":{overrides:{circleCount:3}}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},feature:{"feature-expandable-carousel":{overrides:{textContentAlignment:"center"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-carousel":{overrides:{showDotsOnDesktop:!0}}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},cta:{"cta-card":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},faq:{"faq-accordion-image":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table-2":{}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"artisan-craft":{id:"artisan-craft",name:"Artisan Craft",description:"Warm look, serif typography, earthy tones, soft cream canvas, unfussy layout. Best for a rustic, handcrafted look.",tags:["warm","rustic","organic"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"warm-rustic",name:"Warm Rustic",description:"A light, warm artisanal color palette featuring Radix Brown 2 backgrounds for a soft, handcrafted feel. The primary scale provides deep brown tones for high text contrast, while the secondary scale is optimized for light backgrounds that maintain warmth and approachability. Perfect for bakeries, woodworkers, and heritage brands seeking a premium yet accessible organic aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#AD7F58",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dark-artisan",name:"Dark Artisan",description:"A rich, dark artisanal color palette featuring deep charcoal-brown backgrounds with warm amber accents. The inverted primary scale provides luxurious dark tones that create a sophisticated, moody atmosphere. Light text on dark backgrounds ensures excellent readability while maintaining warmth and approachability. Perfect for specialty bakeries, craft coffee roasters, and artisan brands seeking a premium, evening-inspired aesthetic.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#4A3F38",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["elegant-serif","modern","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","literata-noto-sans","bitter-nunito-sans","manrope-lora","vollkorn-jost","petrona-hanken-grotesk","signika-asap"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"libre-baskerville",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"center",showSocial:!0,showButtons:!1}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center",fillViewport:!0}}},feature:{"feature-grid":{overrides:{imageOptions:{showImages:!0,isCaptionInside:!1}}}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"center"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-grid":{}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},cta:{"cta-basic":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}},"contact-form-map":{}},location:{"location-map":{},"location-text-and-map":{}},embed:{},footer:{"footer-logo-highlight":{overrides:{showSocial:!0}}},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"paw-voyage":{id:"paw-voyage",name:"Paw Voyage",description:"Warm playful clarity — cream canvas, bold orange accents, friendly sans-serif type, rounded details, and bento-style layouts. Best for a fun, approachable look.",tags:["playful","friendly","warm"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"sunny-voyage",name:"Sunny Voyage",description:"A warm, travel-ready palette featuring golden yellow primary tones paired with rich rust-brown secondary accents and a vibrant orange theme color. The primary scale delivers bright, sunny highlights on soft cream page backgrounds, while the secondary adds earthy depth for contrast blocks and featured surfaces. The orange accent drives calls to action with confident warmth. Ideal for pet travel services, relocation specialists, boutique travel brands, and premium local service businesses.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#FF9200",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["figtree","instrument-serif-inter","modern","elegant-serif","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","sora-barlow","josefin-sans-karla","bitter-nunito-sans","manrope-lora","playpen-sans-grandstander"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"figtree",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-marketer":{overrides:{navAlignment:"center",isSticky:!1,showButtons:!0}}},footer:{"footer-logo-highlight":{overrides:{showSocial:!0}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split",fillViewport:!0,showButtons:!0}}},feature:{"feature-bento-grid":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}},"feature-portrait-carousel":{},"feature-three-card":{}},gallery:{"gallery-flat-bento":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"center"}},"gallery-bento":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}}},showcase:{"showcase-list":{}},metrics:{"metrics-numbers":{}},testimonial:{"testimonial-fullscreen-slider":{overrides:{showImages:!0}},"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},pricing:{"pricing-table-3":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}},"pricing-table":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}}},faq:{"faq-accordion-image":{},"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split",showButtons:!0}}},location:{"location-card":{overrides:{mapType:"roadmap",zoom:15,tinted:!0}},"location-map":{overrides:{mapType:"roadmap",zoom:15}}},contact:{"contact-form-links":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"left"}},"contact-form-image":{overrides:{imagePosition:"right"}}},cta:{"cta-card-2":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center",showButtons:!0}},"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"center",showButtons:!0}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},embed:{},blog:{"blog-feed":{}}}},"nordic-edge":{id:"nordic-edge",name:"Nordic Edge",description:"Warm cream canvas, elegant serif type, balanced layout. Best for a serene, polished look with understated depth.",tags:["calm","minimal","warm"],isPublished:!0,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"nordic-light",name:"Nordic Light",description:"A warm, low-saturation canvas palette featuring soft cream primary tones at high brightness paired with clean white secondary accents. The primary scale stays airy and understated while deeper neutral contrast supports editorial typography and photography. Ideal for premium wellness, recovery, spa, and mobile service brands seeking a calm Scandinavian-inspired presence.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#938982",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"nordic-dark",name:"Nordic Dark",description:"A deep, dark Scandinavian palette featuring cool charcoal backgrounds with warm cream and amber accents. The inverted primary scale creates a sophisticated nighttime atmosphere while preserving the clean Nordic minimalism. Ideal for premium wellness, spa, and mobile service brands seeking a dark, atmospheric presence with Scandinavian-inspired depth.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#1A2028",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["instrument-serif-inter","elegant-serif","modern","playfair-source","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","manrope-lora","figtree","crimson-pro","raleway-lato","josefin-sans-karla","bitter-nunito-sans","signika-asap","gabarito-atkinson-hyperlegible-next","sora-barlow"],iconStyles:["vinyl","material"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"instrument-serif-inter",defaultIconStyleId:"vinyl",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-detached-transparent":{overrides:{navAlignment:"right",isTransparent:!1,isSticky:!1,showButtons:!0}}},footer:{"footer-info-grid":{overrides:{showSocial:!0,showLegalLinks:!0}}},banner:{"banner-text-and-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split",fillViewport:!0,showButtons:!1}},"banner-card-and-background-image":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,fullscreenOptions:{fillViewport:!0,verticalAlignment:"bottom"}}}},feature:{"feature-three-card":{}},gallery:{"gallery-slideshow":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,slidesPerView:"3",showPagination:!0,contentAlignment:"center"}}},metrics:{"metrics-basic":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}},"metrics-card-highlight":{overrides:{showButtons:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-grid":{overrides:{showButtons:!1}},"testimonial-carousel-card":{}},team:{"team-grid-columns":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,contentAlignment:"split"}}},cta:{"cta-card-2":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,textAlignment:"center"}},"cta-background-image":{overrides:{showButtons:!0,textAlignment:"center"}}},contact:{"contact-form-image":{overrides:{imagePosition:"right"}}},location:{"location-map":{overrides:{zoom:15,mapType:"roadmap"}}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{overrides:{showItemButtons:!0}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},embed:{},blog:{"blog-feed":{},"blog-featured":{}}}},"true-exposure":{id:"true-exposure",name:"True Exposure",description:"Minimal editorial contrast — sharp corners, clean typography, monochrome palettes, generous whitespace, and disciplined grid layouts. Best for a sophisticated, restrained look.",tags:["minimal","editorial","refined"],isPublished:!1,themeConfig:{colorSchemes:[{id:"bold-contrast",name:"Bold Contrast",description:"A bold, dramatic color palette featuring dark blue backgrounds, with high-contrast white text. The primary scale uses the darkest blues for backgrounds, creating a sophisticated, gallery-quality visual impact. Ideal for photography portfolios, creative agencies, art galleries, and visual designers seeking striking, professional presence with deep blue tones.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#4F46E5",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dark-contrast",name:"Dark Contrast",description:"A bold, dramatic dark color palette featuring deep charcoal backgrounds with high-contrast light text. The primary scale uses the darkest tones for backgrounds, creating a sophisticated, gallery-quality visual impact. Ideal for photography portfolios, creative agencies, art galleries, and visual designers seeking striking, professional presence with dark moody tones.",category:"preferred",themeColor:"#EAB308",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-cloud",name:"Neutral Cloud",description:"A clean neutral palette inspired by soft grayscale gradients, pairing misty mid-gray structure with bright silver surfaces and charcoal accents. The tones stay balanced and understated while preserving strong readability and hierarchy. Ideal for professional brands that need a minimal, calm, and versatile visual baseline.",category:"light",themeColor:"#404040",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-porcelain",name:"Neutral Porcelain",description:"A light porcelain-inspired neutral palette with airy stone-gray foundations, soft silver surfaces, and balanced graphite accents for calm, minimal layouts.",category:"light",themeColor:"#212121",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tranquil-rest",name:"Tranquil Rest",description:"A refined, calm color palette featuring warm cream-beige primary tones paired with deep charcoal secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with very high brightness, creating soft, peaceful backgrounds that evoke rest and mindfulness. The secondary provides rich, dark contrast through near-black tones that ground the palette. A saturated deep blue accent adds focused pops of color. High brightness-to-darkness contrast creates clear visual hierarchy while maintaining a serene, contemplative mood. Ideal for wellness brands, creative studios, mindfulness spaces, and artisan businesses seeking a calm, sophisticated, sleep-and-rest-inspired aesthetic.",category:"light",themeColor:"#15118B",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"morning-mist",name:"Morning Mist",description:"A soft, high-brightness palette with barely-there lavender-white primaries and muted slate-blue accents. Both scales sit at very low saturation with extreme brightness, producing an airy, misty calm. The accent introduces a medium-saturation cool violet for focused contrast. Ideal for wellness studios, spas, and creative agencies seeking a delicate, dreamlike lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#5B4FA0",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"pearl-shimmer",name:"Pearl Shimmer",description:"An iridescent cream palette with very low saturation primaries at near-maximum brightness paired with warm rose-gold accents at moderate saturation. The secondary provides a soft blush warmth that prevents the light base from feeling cold. High brightness across both scales with gentle tonal variance creates a luminous, pearlescent quality. Ideal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",category:"light",themeColor:"#9B5E4A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",category:"light",themeColor:"#B8922F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neutral-graphite",name:"Neutral Graphite",description:"A deep neutral palette inspired by graphite swatches, using layered charcoal tones with cool gray contrast and a soft lilac-gray highlight accent.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#424143",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"modern-grid",name:"Modern Grid",description:"A dark modern palette with steel-blue structure, deep cool-gray surfaces, and a clean turquoise accent for product-forward interfaces.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2FA39A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#1A1114",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#0D1B2A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#2D0A1E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",category:"dark",themeColor:"#091B3A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"classic-persian",name:"Classic Persian",description:"A high-contrast classic palette with a rich golden-amber primary foundation, deep navy-charcoal support tones, and a warm muted neutral range. The primary scale radiates warm saturated gold that anchors the palette with opulent warmth, while the secondary provides grounding darkness. A bold crimson accent introduces a strong chromatic focal point for actions and highlights. Suitable for traditional brands that want a composed but confident visual rhythm.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D13F31",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4A03C",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#D4782F",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#E8A317",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#932700",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"rosewood",name:"Rosewood",description:"A rich, saturated pinkish-red palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the warm rose range at medium brightness, creating a bold rosy background. The primary radiates warm chromatic intensity. Ivory secondary provides soft, breathable contrast. A deep plum accent adds sophisticated depth. Ideal for florists, romantic restaurants, and beauty salons seeking saturated warmth.",category:"warm",themeColor:"#C94C60",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"glacier-blue",name:"Glacier Blue",description:"A deep ice-blue palette with moderate saturation in the blue range at low-medium brightness, paired with steel-gray secondary tones at very low saturation. The primary evokes glacial depth while the secondary provides neutral structure. A frost-white accent at very high brightness creates crisp highlights against the cool base. Ideal for HVAC companies, ski resorts, and cold-storage logistics brands.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A6B8A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"moonlit-ocean",name:"Moonlit Ocean",description:"A deep teal palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the blue-green range at low brightness, paired with silver secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. The contrast between deep oceanic primaries and luminous silver surfaces creates moonlit reflections. A midnight-blue accent adds depth. Ideal for marine services, aquariums, and coastal hospitality seeking mysterious, nocturnal cool tones.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0B3D4A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"northern-sky",name:"Northern Sky",description:"A pale sky-blue palette with low saturation in the blue range at very high brightness, paired with cloud-gray secondary tones at minimal saturation. Both scales sit in the high-brightness range, creating an open, expansive feel. A deep teal accent at high saturation and low brightness adds rich, grounded contrast against the airy base. Ideal for airlines, cloud services, and meditation apps seeking serene openness.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#00425A",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"frozen-slate",name:"Frozen Slate",description:"A dark blue-gray palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the cool blue range at very low brightness, creating a frozen, overcast atmosphere. The primary delivers icy darkness with subtle blue undertones. A pale ice-blue secondary provides crisp contrast against the dark base. A steel-blue accent adds cold metallic focus. Ideal for winter sports brands, cold brew companies, and Scandinavian furniture studios.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#1A2530",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"abyss-green",name:"Abyss Green",description:"A dark cold-green palette with moderate saturation in the blue-green range at very low brightness, evoking deep underwater chill. The primary delivers dark emerald depth with cool undertones. A silver-white secondary creates stark contrast. A muted cyan accent adds cold oceanic highlights. Ideal for environmental nonprofits, deep-sea documentaries, and premium seafood restaurants.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#0A2A28",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"polar-night",name:"Polar Night",description:"A very dark indigo palette with moderate saturation in the violet-blue range at very low brightness, capturing the deep blue-purple of arctic night skies. The primary delivers inky cool darkness with chromatic depth. A pale lavender secondary creates ethereal contrast. A bright aurora-blue accent adds celestial highlights. Ideal for planetariums, luxury sleep brands, and Nordic travel agencies.",category:"cool",themeColor:"#11132B",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"dusty-rose",name:"Dusty Rose",description:"A refined, warm color palette featuring desaturated dusty-rose primary tones paired with muted sage-green secondary accents. The primary scale delivers low-to-moderate saturation with medium brightness, producing a gentle, romantic warmth without veering into vibrant pinks. The secondary offers cool, desaturated green tones that ground the palette with an organic contrast. High brightness backgrounds with soft, muted solid tones create an understated elegance. Ideal for florists, boutique bakeries, handmade cosmetics, artisan candle makers, and craft studios seeking a soft, feminine yet sophisticated handcrafted aesthetic.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A693A",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"forest-floor",name:"Forest Floor",description:"A deep moss-green palette with moderate saturation in the green range at low-medium brightness, paired with bark-brown secondary tones at low saturation and low brightness. The primary captures damp forest depth while the secondary adds woody grounding. A mushroom-cream accent at very low saturation and high brightness creates organic highlights. Ideal for landscapers, organic farms, and eco-lodges seeking rich woodland character.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#3A5F40",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"clay-earth",name:"Clay Earth",description:"A warm clay palette with moderate saturation in the red-orange range at medium brightness, paired with ochre secondary tones at moderate saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales share earthy undertones at different lightness levels, creating a sun-baked, terracotta warmth. A dried-grass accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds organic texture. Ideal for pottery studios, natural skincare brands, and farm-to-table restaurants.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#A0522D",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"stone-garden",name:"Stone Garden",description:"A soft sage palette with low saturation in the green-gray range at high brightness, paired with warm limestone secondary tones at very low saturation and high brightness. Both scales are gentle and muted, creating a zen-garden tranquility. A river-pebble accent at low saturation and medium brightness adds subtle grounding. Ideal for yoga studios, garden centers, and sustainable fashion brands seeking understated organic elegance.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#5B7A5E",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"peat-moss",name:"Peat Moss",description:"A dark olive-green palette with moderate saturation in the green-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich forest undergrowth and decomposing leaf litter. The primary delivers deep moss darkness with organic warmth. A warm sand secondary provides earthy contrast. A muted amber accent adds fungal-gold highlights. Ideal for hiking brands, national park services, and mushroom foragers.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1C2A16",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"volcanic-soil",name:"Volcanic Soil",description:"A dark warm-brown palette with low-to-moderate saturation in the red-brown range at very low brightness, evoking rich volcanic earth and dark mineral soil. The primary delivers deep umber darkness with organic depth. A warm terracotta secondary provides earthy warmth. A burnt sienna accent adds iron-oxide focal points. Ideal for coffee roasters, chocolate makers, and geothermal spas.",category:"natural",themeColor:"#1E140E",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"electric-clash",name:"Electric Clash",description:"A max-intensity electric palette that pairs signal red with saturated cobalt and a vivid lime accent for loud, attention-grabbing interfaces.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#2C1249",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-pulse",name:"Neon Pulse",description:"A max-saturation neon palette with hot magenta primary at very high saturation and medium brightness, paired with electric cyan secondary at very high saturation and medium-high brightness. Both scales push chromatic intensity to the limit against a near-black base. The complementary warm-cool neon pairing creates pulsing visual energy. Ideal for nightclubs, gaming studios, and streetwear brands seeking maximum visual impact.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#FF2D95",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"laser-grid",name:"Laser Grid",description:"A neon green palette with very high saturation in the green range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy-blue primary at moderate saturation and very low brightness. The primary creates a rich midnight-blue canvas that grounds the electric neon greens with cool depth rather than purple darkness. A warm neon yellow-green accent adds scanning-beam highlights. Ideal for VR arcades, cybersecurity firms, and synthwave-inspired brands seeking retrofuturistic intensity.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#16275F",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"plasma-wave",name:"Plasma Wave",description:"An electric violet palette with a bright orchid-purple accent at high saturation and medium-high brightness, paired with hot pink secondary at very high saturation. The accent delivers a vivid, luminous purple that lifts the palette with vibrant energy against the dark primary base. The dual-neon pairing of orchid and hot pink creates surging plasma energy. Ideal for electronic music labels, esports teams, and futuristic beauty brands.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#974CA1",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"acid-mint",name:"Acid Mint",description:"An electric palette with a bright lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the yellow range, creating a vivid, energetic warm base. The primary delivers punchy sunshine intensity that pairs with the neon green accent for maximum electric contrast. A dark graphite secondary provides legible contrast. A vivid green accent adds electric punch against the vibrant yellow canvas. Ideal for energy drink brands, fitness apps, and tech startups seeking electric brightness.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#00E676",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"ultra-violet",name:"Ultra Violet",description:"An electric palette with a vivid sky-blue primary at high brightness and moderate saturation in the cyan range, creating a bright, cheerful cool base. The primary delivers a bold, saturated blue lightness that energizes the layout. A deep dark-purple secondary provides dramatic contrast. A hot neon magenta accent adds electric highlights against the vibrant blue canvas. Ideal for music festivals, creative agencies, and beauty brands seeking a light-on-neon aesthetic.",category:"electric",themeColor:"#D946EF",themeColorCategory:"accent",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"vibrant-market",name:"Vibrant Market",description:"A bold, highly saturated color palette featuring deep indigo-navy primary tones paired with vivid hot pink secondary accents. The primary scale provides moderate saturation at low-medium brightness, creating a rich, dramatic dark base. The secondary offers high-saturation warm pink tones that create maximum visual energy and contrast against the cool primary. A warm golden-orange accent adds further vibrancy. This is the most chromatic and energetic scheme in the collection. Ideal for artisan markets, craft fairs, creative collectives, mixed-media artists, and vibrant street-food vendors seeking a bold, festival-inspired, maximalist aesthetic.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#E77493",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"candy-pop",name:"Candy Pop",description:"A bright bubblegum-pink palette with high saturation in the pink range at high brightness, paired with sunshine-yellow secondary at very high saturation and maximum brightness. Both scales are intensely cheerful with warm, sugary energy. A turquoise accent at high saturation and medium brightness adds a cool counterpoint. Ideal for ice cream shops, children's brands, and party supply businesses seeking maximum joyfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF69B4",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"tropical-splash",name:"Tropical Splash",description:"A bright tropical palette with a sunny lemon-yellow primary at high brightness and moderate saturation, paired with vivid coral secondary at high saturation for warm-cool tropical contrast. The primary delivers cheerful sunshine energy while the coral and aqua accents create vibrant island warmth. Ideal for smoothie bars, surf shops, and tropical vacation brands seeking vibrant island vibes.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FF6B6B",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"confetti-burst",name:"Confetti Burst",description:"A bold purple palette with high saturation in the violet range at medium brightness, paired with tangerine secondary at very high saturation and high brightness. The complementary purple-orange pairing creates maximum chromatic contrast. A lime-green accent at high saturation and high brightness adds a third voice of celebration. Ideal for event planners, craft supply stores, and carnival brands seeking bold, multi-hued excitement.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#7C3AED",themeColorCategory:"secondary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"sunshine-pop",name:"Sunshine Pop",description:"A bright sunshine-yellow palette with very high saturation in the yellow range at high brightness, paired with a deep navy secondary for strong readable contrast. A rich crimson accent at moderate-high saturation and low-medium brightness provides a bold, deeply saturated background base. The dark red grounds the playful energy with confident warmth while the yellow and navy add vibrant focal points. Ideal for lemonade stands, kids' toy brands, and summer festival promoters seeking bold, warm playfulness.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#FFE533",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}},{id:"neon-splash",name:"Neon Splash",description:"A bold playful palette with a rich ocean-blue primary providing cool depth, paired with a vivid neon-lime secondary that delivers maximum chartreuse energy as a punchy counterpoint. The warm-cool contrast between electric green and deep blue creates high-energy visual tension. A vivid hot-pink accent adds playful dynamism. Ideal for smoothie bars, trampoline parks, and skateboard brands seeking maximum visual punch.",category:"playful",themeColor:"#13578A",themeColorCategory:"primary",sectionColorOverrides:{}}],typographyStyles:["modern","elegant-serif","bricolage-grotesque","playfair-source","nunito","oswald-source","space-grotesk","unbounded-geist","albert-sans","libre-baskerville","fraunces-open-sans","work-sans-rubik","lexend","figtree","crimson-pro","syne-geist","montagu-slab","raleway-lato","josefin-sans-karla","sora-barlow","rethink-sans-commissioner","funnel-display-onest","libre-bodoni-chivo","newsreader-plus-jakarta-sans","archivo-alegreya"],iconStyles:["material","vinyl"],defaultTypographyStyleId:"figtree",defaultIconStyleId:"material",defaultKickerVariantId:"text-kicker"},sections:{header:{"header-basic":{overrides:{navAlignment:"left",showSocial:!1,showButtons:!0}}},banner:{"banner-diagonal-grid":{}},feature:{"feature-three-card":{}},gallery:{"gallery-grid":{}},text:{"text-basic":{overrides:{alignment:"split"}}},showcase:{"showcase-grid":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"center",itemSize:"md"}}},metrics:{"metrics-numbers":{}},team:{"team-grid":{overrides:{showImages:!0}}},testimonial:{"testimonial-grid":{}},pricing:{"pricing-table":{}},faq:{"faq-accordion":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"split"}}},cta:{"cta-background-image":{overrides:{textAlignment:"split"}}},contact:{"contact-form-text":{overrides:{contentAlignment:"sp