eal for jewelry brands, wedding services, and luxury boutiques.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#FBF7F2"),isDynamic:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#C9A88E"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#9B5E4A"),isThemeColor:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.sand,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"interactive-bg-2"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"canvas-bg"},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"honey-dew":eV({id:"honey-dew",name:"Honey Dew",category:"light",description:"A warm honey-tinted palette with very low saturation in the yellow range at near-maximum brightness, paired with soft olive secondary tones. The primary delivers sunlit warmth without intensity while the secondary grounds with quiet green-gray. A muted gold accent adds gentle focal points. Ideal for organic grocers, honey farms, and daycare centers seeking a warm, approachable lightness.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#FDF8ED"),isDynamic:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#6B7A5E"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#B8922F"),isThemeColor:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.olive,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"interactive-bg-2"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"canvas-bg"},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"neutral-graphite":eU,"modern-grid":eG,"obsidian-ember":eV({id:"obsidian-ember",name:"Obsidian Ember",category:"dark",description:"A near-black palette with very low brightness primaries and deep crimson accents at high saturation. The primary provides obsidian-dark foundations while the secondary adds warm charcoal tones. The accent introduces smoldering red at moderate-to-high saturation, creating dramatic ember-like focal points against the void. Ideal for premium steakhouses, whiskey brands, and luxury automotive services.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#1A1114"),isThemeColor:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#3D2A2A"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#C4302B"),isDynamic:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.mauve,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"solid"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg",isInverted:!0},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"midnight-ink":eV({id:"midnight-ink",name:"Midnight Ink",category:"dark",description:"A deep navy-black palette with very low brightness and moderate saturation in the cool-blue range, paired with warm gold accents at high saturation and medium brightness. The primary evokes the depth of ink on dark paper while the secondary adds deep blue-gray structure. The gold accent creates luxurious contrast against the dark canvas. Ideal for law firms, financial advisors, publishing houses, and luxury brands seeking authoritative elegance.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#0D1B2A"),isThemeColor:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#1B2D45"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#D4A84B"),isDynamic:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.slate,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"black",contrast:10}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"interactive-bg"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg",isInverted:!0},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"deep-burgundy":eV({id:"deep-burgundy",name:"Deep Burgundy",category:"dark",description:"A richly saturated dark wine palette with moderate-to-high saturation in the red-purple range at low brightness, paired with dusty rose secondary tones. The primary delivers deep velvet darkness with visible chromatic warmth rather than flat black. A warm copper accent adds luxurious metallic highlights. Ideal for wine bars, fine dining, and high-end fashion brands seeking saturated dark elegance.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#2D0A1E"),isThemeColor:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#C28B8B"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#C87941"),isDynamic:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.mauve,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"interactive-bg"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg",isInverted:!0},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"deep-ocean":eV({id:"deep-ocean",name:"Deep Ocean",category:"dark",description:"A saturated deep-blue palette with high saturation in the blue range at very low brightness, paired with warm amber secondary for striking contrast. The primary evokes abyssal oceanic depth with visible blue chromatic intensity rather than neutral black. A bright teal accent adds bioluminescent focal points. Ideal for dive shops, aquatic brands, and oceanography organizations seeking vivid dark depth.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#091B3A"),isThemeColor:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#E8B84B"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#0FBFC4"),isDynamic:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.slate,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"black",contrast:10}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"black",contrast:10}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg",isInverted:!0},featured:{category:"secondary",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"classic-persian":eY,"desert-canyon":eV({id:"desert-canyon",name:"Desert Canyon",category:"warm",description:"A warm terracotta palette with moderate saturation in the orange-red range at medium brightness, paired with burnt sienna secondary tones. Both scales share warm undertones but differ in lightness, creating depth through tonal warmth rather than hue contrast. A warm gold accent adds sun-baked highlights. Ideal for outdoor adventure brands, southwestern restaurants, and travel agencies.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#C67B5C"),isDynamic:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#2C1D17"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#D4A03C"),isThemeColor:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.sand,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"black",contrast:10}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg-2"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"canvas-bg-2"},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"golden-hour":eV({id:"golden-hour",name:"Golden Hour",category:"warm",description:"A rich amber palette with high saturation in the golden-orange range at medium-high brightness, paired with deep bronze secondary tones at low brightness. The primary radiates warm sunset energy while the secondary provides grounding depth. A burnt orange accent at high saturation bridges the two. Ideal for photography studios, wine bars, and artisan food brands seeking a golden, atmospheric warmth.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#F5DEB3"),isDynamic:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#3B2510"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#D4782F"),isThemeColor:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.sand,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"primary",scale:"interactive-bg-3"}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"canvas-bg"},featured:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"spiced-saffron":eV({id:"spiced-saffron",name:"Spiced Saffron",category:"warm",description:"A deep saffron palette with high saturation in the yellow-orange range at medium brightness, paired with cinnamon secondary tones at moderate saturation and low-medium brightness. The primary exudes aromatic richness while the secondary adds spiced depth. A warm ivory accent at very low saturation and high brightness provides breathing room. Ideal for spice shops, Indian restaurants, and artisan tea brands.",colorPalette:{primary:{colorSet:_("#FFF4E0"),isDynamic:!0},secondary:{colorSet:_("#8B4513"),isDynamic:!0},accent:{colorSet:_("#E8A317"),isThemeColor:!0},neutral:{colorSet:_(A.referenceBaseColors.neutral.sand,{neutral:!0})}},themableComponentColorOverrides:{button:{"flat-button":{primary:{backgroundColor:{category:"accent",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"black",contrast:10}},secondary:{backgroundColor:{category:"secondary",scale:"solid"},foregroundColor:{tint:"white",contrast:7}}}}},globalColorOverrides:{background:{base:{category:"primary",scale:"canvas-bg-2"},featured:{category:"secondary",scale:"solid"}},foreground:{strong:{tint:"neutral",contrast:9},medium:{tint:"neutral",contrast:7},light:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},accent:{tint:"theme",contrast:7},divider:{tint:"neutral",contrast:5},border:{tint:"neutral",contrast:2}}}}),"molten-sunset":eV({id:"molten-sunset",name:"Molten Sunset",category:"warm",description:"A deep burnt-umber palette with high saturation in the dark red-brown range at low brightness, used as a bold, moody saturated background. The primary delivers smoldering warmth with rich chocolatey depth. Deep charcoal secondary provides grounding contrast against the dark base. A warm yellow accent adds solar highlights that pop against the deep umber. Ideal for BBQ joints, fire pit bars, and adventure touring brands.",colorPalet